<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Tejasri's futuristic B.Tech student portfolio">
  <title>Tejasri | Futuristic Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #070b18;
      --panel: rgba(17, 27, 53, .72);
      --cyan: #55f3ff;
      --violet: #a78bfa;
      --text: #edf5ff;
      --muted: #aab8d1;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; color: var(--text);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%, rgba(72, 91, 220, .25), transparent 32%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 75%, rgba(0, 224, 255, .16), transparent 30%),
        var(--bg);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    body::before {
      content: ""; position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: .22;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(85,243,255,.12) 1px, transparent 1px),
                        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(85,243,255,.12) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 42px 42px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent 90%);
    }
    nav {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; padding: 25px 7%;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .logo { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 3px; }
    nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; margin-left: 22px; font-size: .9rem; }
    nav a:hover { color: var(--cyan); }
    main { max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; padding: 65px 7% 90px; }
    .hero { min-height: 55vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
    .tag {
      color: var(--cyan); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 4px;
      font-size: .78rem; font-weight: bold;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 10vw, 6.8rem); line-height: .98; margin: 18px 0; }
    h1 span {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), var(--violet));
      -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
    }
    .intro { max-width: 600px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; }
    .button {
      display: inline-block; margin-top: 22px; padding: 13px 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--cyan); border-radius: 7px; color: var(--cyan);
      text-decoration: none; width: fit-content; box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(85,243,255,.12);
    }
    .button:hover { background: rgba(85,243,255,.1); }
    section { margin-top: 65px; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    h2 span { color: var(--cyan); }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
    .card {
      background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid rgba(117, 154, 220, .22);
      border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px; backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    }
    .card h3 { margin-top: 0; color: var(--cyan); }
    .card p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 0; }
    .skill {
      display: inline-block; padding: 9px 13px; margin: 5px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(85,243,255,.35); border-radius: 20px;
      color: #dffcff; background: rgba(85,243,255,.07); font-size: .92rem;
    }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 28px 15px; color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid rgba(117,154,220,.18); }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      nav { padding: 20px 6%; } nav a { margin-left: 10px; font-size: .8rem; }
      main { padding: 45px 6% 70px; } .hero { min-height: 48vh; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">T<span style="color:#a78bfa">.</span></div>
    <div><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#skills">Skills</a><a href="#education">Education</a></div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="tag">Welcome to my digital space</div>
      <h1>Hi, I'm<br><span>Tejasri.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro">A B.Tech student exploring technology, building new skills, and turning creative ideas into meaningful digital experiences.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#about">Explore my portfolio&nbsp; ↗</a>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
      <h2><span>01.</span> About Me</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>Hello! I'm Tejasri. I am pursuing a Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech). I enjoy learning new technologies, solving problems, and improving my abilities step by step. I'm excited to grow as a technology professional.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="education">
      <h2><span>02.</span> Education</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Bachelor of Technology</h3>
          <p><strong>Qualification:</strong> B.Tech<br><strong>Status:</strong> Student</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills">
      <h2><span>03.</span> Skills & Interests</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="skill">C Programming</span>
        <span class="skill">HTML</span>
        <span class="skill">CSS</span>
        <span class="skill">Communication</span>
        <span class="skill">Problem Solving</span>
        <span class="skill">Teamwork</span>
        <p style="margin-top:18px">These are starter skills and interests. Update this section as you learn and gain experience.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>© 2026 Tejasri · Designed with a futuristic vision</footer>
</body>
</html>
